{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-sng-1-intro","title":"Song of Solomon 1 — Chapter Introduction","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":0,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":0},"content":"<p>remove. 12:1; Job 13:26; Ps 25:7; 2Pe 3:11-14 sorrow. or, anger. Ps 90:7-11 and put. Job 20:11; 2Co 7:1; 2Ti 2:22 for. 1:2,14; Ps 39:5; Pr 22:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-1-1","title":"Song of Solomon 1:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The church's love unto Christ. 5 She confesses her deformity, 7 and prays to be directed to his flock. 8 Christ directs her to the shepherd's tents; 9 and shewing his love to her, 11 gives her gracious promises. 12 The church and Christ congratulate one another.</p>\n<p>song. Ps 14:1; *title Isa 5:1 Solomon's. 1Ki 4:32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-1-2","title":"Song of Solomon 1:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>him. 5:16; 8:1; Ge 27:26,27; 29:11; 45:15; Ps 2:12; Lu 15:20; Ac 21:7 1Pe 5:14 thy love. Heb. thy loves. 4; 2:4; 4:10; 7:6,9,12; 8:2; Ps 36:7; 63:3-5; Isa 25:6; 55:1,2 Mt 26:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-1-3","title":"Song of Solomon 1:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>the savour. 3:6; 4:10; 5:5,13; Ex 30:23-28; Ps 45:7,8; 133:2; Pr 27:9; Ec 7:1 Isa 61:3; Joh 12:3; 2Co 2:14-16; Php 4:18 thy name. Ex 33:12,19; 34:5-7; Ps 89:15,16; Isa 9:6,7; Jer 23:5,6 Mt 1:21-23; Php 2:9,10 the virgins. 6:8; Ps 45:14; Mt 25:1; 2Co 11:2; Re 14:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-1-4","title":"Song of Solomon 1:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Draw. Jer 31:3; Ho 11:4; Joh 6:44; 12:32; Php 2:12,13 we will. Ps 119:32,60; Heb 12:1 the king. 2:3-5; 3:4; Ps 45:14,15; Mt 25:10; Joh 14:2,3; Eph 2:6 we will be. Ps 98:4-9; 149:2; Isa 25:8; 45:25; 61:3; Zep 3:14; Zec 9:9; Lu 2:10 Php 3:3; 4:4; 1Pe 1:8 remember. 2; Ps 42:4; 48:9; 63:5; 103:1,2; 111:4; Isa 63:7; Lu 22:19 1Co 11:23-26 the upright love thee. or, they love thee uprightly. 3; Joh 21:15-17; Eph 6:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-1-5","title":"Song of Solomon 1:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>black. Isa 53:2; Mt 10:25; 1Co 4:10-13; 1Jo 3:1 comely. Ps 90:17; 149:4; Isa 61:10; Eze 16:14; Mt 22:11; Lu 15:22; Ro 13:14 2Co 5:21; Eph 5:26 O ye. Ps 45:9; Lu 13:34; Ga 4:26 as the tents. Ps 120:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-1-6","title":"Song of Solomon 1:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Look. Ru 1:19-21 because. Job 30:30; Jer 8:21; La 4:8; Mr 4:6; Ac 14:22 my mother's. Ps 69:8; Jer 12:6; Mic 7:6; Mt 10:22,25,35,36; Lu 12:51-53 Ga 4:29 keeper. 8:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-1-7","title":"Song of Solomon 1:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>O thou. 2:3; 3:1-4; 5:8,10,16; Ps 18:1; 116:1; Isa 5:1; 26:9; Mt 10:37 Joh 21:17; 1Pe 1:8; 2:7 thou feedest. Ge 37:16; Ps 23:1,2; 80:1; Isa 40:11; Mic 5:4; Joh 10:11,28,29 Re 7:17 for. 1Sa 12:20,21; Ps 28:1; Joh 6:67-69; 1Jo 2:19 turneth aside. or, is veiled. Col 3:14-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-1-8","title":"Song of Solomon 1:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>O thou. 15; 2:10; 4:1,7,10; 5:9; 6:1,4-10; 7:1-13; Ps 16:3; 45:11,13 Eph 5:27; Re 19:7,8 go. Pr 8:34; Jer 6:16; 1Co 11:1; Heb 6:12; 11:4-40; 13:7; Jas 2:21,25 Jas 5:10; 1Pe 3:6 feed. Joh 21:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-1-9","title":"Song of Solomon 1:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>O my. 2:2,10,13; 4:1,7; 5:2; 6:4; Joh 15:14,15 to a. 1Ki 10:28; 2Ch 1:14-17; Isa 31:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-1-10","title":"Song of Solomon 1:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>thy cheeks. Ge 24:22,47; Isa 3:18-21; Eze 16:11-13; 2Pe 1:3,4 thy neck. 4:9; Ge 41:42; Nu 31:50; Pr 1:9; 1Pe 3:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-1-11","title":"Song of Solomon 1:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>8:9; Ge 1:26; Ps 149:4; Eph 5:25-27; Php 3:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-1-12","title":"Song of Solomon 1:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>the king. 7:5; Ps 45:1; Mt 22:11; 25:34 sitteth. 4:16; Mt 22:4; 26:26-28; Lu 24:30-32; Re 3:20 my. 4:13-16; Joh 12:3; Php 4:18; Re 8:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-1-13","title":"Song of Solomon 1:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>bundle. 4:6,14; 5:1,5,13; Ge 43:11; Ps 45:8; Joh 19:39 he shall. 2:7; 3:5; 8:3,4; Eph 3:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-1-14","title":"Song of Solomon 1:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>beloved. 13; 2:3 camphire. or, cypress. 4:13,14 En-gedi Jos 15:62; 1Sa 23:29; 24:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-1-15","title":"Song of Solomon 1:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>thou art fair. 8; 4:1,7,10; 5:12; 7:6 my love. or, my companion. Mal 2:14 thou hast. 4:1; 5:12; 2Co 11:2,3; Eph 1:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-1-16","title":"Song of Solomon 1:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>thou art. 2:3; 5:10-16; Ps 45:2; Zec 9:17; Php 3:8,9; Re 5:11-13 also. 3:7; Ps 110:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-1-17","title":"Song of Solomon 1:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>beams. 8:9; 2Ch 2:8,9; Ps 92:12; 1Ti 3:15,16; Heb 11:10; 1Pe 2:4,5 rafters. or, galleries. 7:5; Eze 41:16; 42:3</p>"}]}